1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,420
This is InventDB Legal.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,920
Practice management for law firms, built on InventDB SOAR.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,920
One place for the whole practice: matters, the docket, time, billing and client money.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,920
Sign in, and each person lands on their own dashboard.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,920
The whole practice at a glance: matters, deadlines, hearings and the money.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,420
New business: an enquiry becomes a client.

7
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:37,920
A workflow runs the conflict check, then waits for a person to decide.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,920
Case management: one file for every matter.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,920
The demo firm has 1,300 matters, shown as a docket or as a table.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,920
A matter holds the court, judge, case number, fee terms and its trust balance.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,920
Related shows everything that points at it: time, costs, invoices, trust.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,920
Click any record, and a read-only panel opens it with its links and files.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,920
Describe a new matter in plain English.

14
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,920
The form fills itself. Nothing saves until you press Save.

15
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,420
Risk and deadlines: nothing missed.

16
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:17,420
Hearings, depositions and mediations on one calendar.

17
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:21,920
Every deadline carries its rule, trigger and owner.

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,420
Documents: every paper in its place,

19
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:27,920
found by name, by the text inside or by meaning.

20
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,420
Profitability: every hour accounted for.

21
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,420
Time is recorded against the matter, with UTBMS codes.

22
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:38,920
A live report lists unbilled work, matter by matter.

23
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,420
Compliance: client money, by the book.

24
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:45,420
Every trust deposit, transfer and disbursement is recorded,

25
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,920
through to settlements and the net to the client.

26
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,920
Analyze: ask the practice a question in plain English.

27
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,920
It runs the queries and answers with a chart.

28
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,920
Business Litigation carries the most unbilled work: $125,158.50.

29
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,920
Every answer shows its SQL. Analyze only reads; changes come back as proposals.

30
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,920
Live reports re-query on open. Edit one by describing the change.

31
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:19,920
Workflows automate the routine. When one needs a decision, it stops and asks.

32
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:25,420
Rehearse before going live. Every run is kept.

33
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:31,420
Everyone sees only their part of the firm, enforced by InventDB, the API and the app.

34
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:34,920
Search the whole firm from anywhere.

35
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,920
Light or dark,

36
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:41,920
and it works on a phone.

37
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:46,420
Under the hood: React and TypeScript, a thin Python API, and InventDB SOAR.

38
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:50,920
InventDB is the database and the identity provider. No second datastore.

39
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,920
Row-level security applies to every request.

40
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,420
InventDB Legal. The whole practice, in one place.

41
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:59,920
Built on InventDB SOAR. inventdb.com
